        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very expensive to fix my trailer. all my\nTrailer lights working they change it light & holder I can fixed les then $1000. I paid\nTo them $2750 for inspection & repair\nI'm no happy please make sure when\nYou bring to do something. but they nice to talk with people. My friend did good. Only my bill to high.",
        "time": 1732921559,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Field Racer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101257358614349687732/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKOnfgXEFhhGELu7iXBsGGLbN1fovtvIhftZlmWzc83odDQ3hs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Dude at the counter had a bit of an attitude, but you know what, he did know exactly what he was talking about.. maybe I just caught him on a bad day nonetheless his knowledge outweighed my impression of him because in the end he still did a great job still gave me great advice and the correct products.. maybe it was just me? LOL still a great business",
        "time": 1658231116,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stan F",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100890548356283744786/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJLZFqD9Q3JSuiH0gb_ponylSmlQQUZYqrpAsIXgKoHzyijsY_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Was referred to Suspension Bellerive by a friend.  I was looking to go in to get an airlift put in for my truck.  I mentioned to the staff that I was having some rear sag when I hooked up my travel trailer.  Eric then suggested changing the coil springs to the variable rate coil springs in the rear.  Really appreciated the advice as I have no more rear sag, and I increased the load capacity in the rear.  Thanks so much!",
        "time": 1655871186,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112715337501112142045/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKFxrvJqWzjM531fqfSY37JGaAAuA5eLX-lrRLNadzfmVVbKwQR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I had good experience with them, patrick and eric both are good people to deal with. Good price and fixed my truck on time. I will go back again.",
